Not done: nobody but me and the four instances has read the statements against the mathematics. The three theorems of MinGroup.lean, with the definitions maskW (Weighted.lean), levelsEW, levelsFW (MinGroup.lean) and gOf, xOf, minU, minB (Rule.lean), are what a reader has to trust; everything else is checked by Lean.
